People[ normally] solve this problem by[ oil]ing up, but I don’t like it[ since it] makes[ the food] greasy. Using[ non]-stick[ bakeware] is a healthier, more convenient, and more practical way of baking.
The next thing that you might not have known is that non-stick bake[ware] is so much easier to clean than more conventional types. It is a no-brainer really – if[ nothing] sticks to the surface then there won’[t] be anything to scrub, scrape or wash off.
